      "text": "Minotaur"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Andrey Zvyagintsev transposes Claude Chabrol’s La Femme infidèle to contemporary Russia, delivering a magnificent political allegory that dissects the mechanics of ego, violence and corruption."
